.TH C2SH 1 "2026-09-26" "c2sh 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
c2sh \- C17 interactive Unix shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B c2sh
.RB [ -c " command" ]
.RI [ script ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B c2sh
is a Linux-first interactive Unix shell implemented directly with POSIX process, terminal, signal, and file-descriptor APIs.
.SH OPERATORS
.BR | , || , && , ; , & , < , > , >> , 2> , 2>>
.SH BUILTINS
.BR cd , pwd , echo , export , unset , env , history , jobs , fg , bg , kill , type , which , help , source , true , false , exit .
.SH FILES
.I ~/.c2shrc
.br
.I ~/.c2sh_history
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B C2SH_HISTORY_FILE
.br
.B C2SH_HISTORY_SIZE
.br
.B C2SH_NO_COLOR
.SH EXIT STATUS
The shell returns the last command status, or the explicit status supplied to
.B exit .
.SH SECURITY
The shell executes commands with the current user's privileges. Startup files and scripts are executable code and must be trusted.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sh (1),
.BR bash (1),
.BR execve (2),
.BR fork (2),
.BR pipe (2),
.BR termios (3)
